{"story":{"id":"site-site-robot-debris","title":{"zh":"机器人碎片","en":"Robot Debris"},"category":"precursors","kind":"site","image":"art/07afcc0b4413be450471.webp","start":"archaeological_site_types:site_robot_debris","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"这颗小行星的表面覆盖满了被其低重力束缚的机器人碎片。看起来它们都是由军事行动造成的。如果这些作战机器人没有被破坏到无法修复的话，本来是足够武装几只军队的。","en":"The entire surface of this small asteroid is covered in robot debris, trapped in its weak gravity field. All of it appears military in nature, and there are enough combat droids here to outfit several armies had they not be shattered beyond all repair."},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"C2 precursor review (resumed, Claude)","scope":{"zh":"整条故事：遗址的出现方式、全部阶段（按定义顺序）、最后结果及其互斥关系、掷骰失败时的事件池；中英文正文已读。","en":"Whole story: how the site appears, every stage in definition order, the final outcome(s) and their exclusivity, the roll-failure incident pool; both languages read."},"sources":["common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt","localisation/simp_chinese","localisation/english"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/site-site-robot-debris.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:site_robot_debris","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"ancrel.6250","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:401"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.6255","parent":"n2","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"ancrel.6260","parent":"n3","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"archaeological_site_types:site_robot_debris","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"机器人碎片","en":"Robot Debris"},"texts":[{"zh":"这颗小行星的表面覆盖满了被其低重力束缚的机器人碎片。看起来它们都是由军事行动造成的。如果这些作战机器人没有被破坏到无法修复的话，本来是足够武装几只军队的。","en":"The entire surface of this small asteroid is covered in robot debris, trapped in its weak gravity field. All of it appears military in nature, and there are enough combat droids here to outfit several armies had they not be shattered beyond all repair."}],"sections":[{"zh":"这颗小行星的表面覆盖满了被其低重力束缚的机器人碎片。看起来它们都是由军事行动造成的。如果这些作战机器人没有被破坏到无法修复的话，本来是足够武装几只军队的。","en":"The entire surface of this small asteroid is covered in robot debris, trapped in its weak gravity field. All of it appears military in nature, and there are enough combat droids here to outfit several armies had they not be shattered beyond all repair."}],"image":"art/07afcc0b4413be450471.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.6250","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:401","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"site-site-robot-debris"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8002","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r1","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:4","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8003","kind":"failure","conditional":true,